@page "/about"


<div class="card hero-card mx-auto mb-4 about-card">
    <div class="card-body">

        <!-- About Us Intro -->

        <div class="card-intro">
            <p>
                At <strong>Hopeful Horizons Therapeutics, LLC</strong>, we believe that healing begins with hope—and with the right support, every person has the ability to grow and thrive.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Tiffany's picture -->

        <div class="about-image">

            <img src="images/tiffany-headshot.jpg" alt="Tiffany Richards, LCSW, CADC">

        </div>

        <!-- About Us Info: Tiffany -->

        <p class="about-text">

            I'm <strong>Tiffany Richards, LCSW, CADC</strong>, founder of Hopeful Horizons Therapeutics in Ashland, Kentucky. I'm a Licensed Clinical Social Worker and Certified Alcohol and Drug Counselor, 
            offering trauma-informed therapy to individuals, families, and communities seeking meaningful change.

        </p>

        <!-- Tiffany's Background -->

        <h4>My Background</h4>

        <p class="about-text">

            I hold a Master's in Social Work from the University of Kentucky, a Bachelor's from Morehead State University, and an Associate degree from Ashland Community and Technical College.
            <br><br>
            My experience spans crisis intervention, case management, and program development, giving me a holistic view of each client's journey.

        </p>

        <!-- Specialities -->

        <h4>Specialties</h4>

        <ul class="about-list">
            <li>Trauma and PTSD</li>
            <li>Anxiety and depression</li>
            <li>Substance use and recovery</li>
            <li>Life transitions and relationship stress</li>
            <li>Mood regulation and coping skills</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- More Details -->

        <h4>Therapeutic Approaches</h4>

        <p class="about-text">
            I'm trained in EMDR Therapy, CBT, and Motivational Interviewing. These evidence-based methods are tailored to your needs, and my trauma-informed lens ensures safety, empowerment, and collaboration throughout your healing process.
        </p>

        <h4>What to Expect</h4>

        <p class="about-text">
            Our first session explores your history, concerns, and goals. Together, we'll build a treatment plan that feels achievable and meaningful.
        </p>

        <ul class="about-list">
            <li>A safe, confidential space where your story is honored</li>
            <li>Collaborative goal-setting and practical strategies</li>
            <li>Support for processing trauma and building resilience</li>
            <li>Empathy, honesty, and integrity in every interaction</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Services Button -->

        <div class="hero-cta" style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="/services" class="btn btn-primary">🡺 Learn More About Our Services</a>

        </div>

        <!-- End of Section  -->

        <p class="about-quote">
            You don't have to walk this path alone. Healing is possible... and it starts with hope.
        </p>

    </div>
</div>